voxel_map.hpp -- voxel-map optimization and bookkeeping fixes.

1. Handle voxel counts smaller than the configured residual worker count.
2. Guard LM gain and convergence ratios against zero denominators.
3. Propagate an invalid optimizer-state index as an exception.
4. Fix wrong-container end-iterator comparisons in both voxel-cutting paths.

Every hunk has an in-source `voxelslam_bridge:` rationale. The complete file
delta is generated with `diff -U3` and applied with zero fuzz.

